# AdMob identifiers. Not secret - they ship inside the APK - but kept out of the
# repository so a clone with no identifiers packages with ads OFF and still
# builds. That is what lets CI publish an unsigned audit AAB nobody can turn the
# ads SDK on in. See docs/ADS.md.
ads.properties
